#: arma_alarm/ArmaFireAftermath3/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Because you're a wussy?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaFireAftermath3/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "I know! I feel so ALIVE!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaFireAftermath3/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Hey, wait a minute..."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaFireAftermath3/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Where are the Smokes?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaFireAftermath3/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "They're dead, Arma. They threw themselves into the fire."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaFireAftermath3/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Went up in smoke, I'm afraid."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaFireAftermath3/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Huh. I could see that, actually."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaFireAftermath3/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "They did?!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaFireAftermath3/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "...that tracks, actually."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmacrawlspaceEnding/0/0
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Well, she's in the crawlspace. Let's check on her."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmacrawlspaceEnding/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey Arma. Are you ready to behave yourself?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmacrawlspaceEnding/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Arma, you can come out now. The Smokes are dead."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmacrawlspaceEnding/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Heck no! I'd do it again in a heartbeat!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmacrawlspaceEnding/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "No... but they were so—"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmacrawlspaceEnding/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Eh, to be honest, I can see that happening."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmacrawlspaceEnding/0/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "They were YOLO types."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmacrawlspaceEnding/0/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Couldn't have ended any other way, really."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmacrawlspaceEnding/0/c-1/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "I respect it. But I'm glad they're gone."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmacrawlspaceEnding/0/c-1/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Alas. The beautiful always die young."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/0
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "You know, now that I don't have those cigarettes whispering in my ear..."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You feel normal again?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You have another voice whispering in your ear?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Yeah... yeah I do."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Huh? No! I actually feel like myself again."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "As a matter of fact, I feel like I should really get back to work."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "This has been a pretty crazy couple days."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Smoke alarm starts smoking and lighting fires? Normal."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah... my brain needs a break."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Haha, yeah... how the heck did we end up here?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Mine too."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Anyway, I just want to thank you for sticking with me through all that."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "I know I can be a handful sometimes, but at least you know I'm not boring!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Although I think I'll try to be a <i>bit</i> more boring after this."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-1/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No more fires, ok?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-1/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If you find any more cigarettes..."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Jeez. Obviously!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-1/c-4/15
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Now that I'm off the smoke, I can't even imagine what I was thinking!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Leave them be, I know."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Well, I'm gonna go take a break. A real break, not a smoke break."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "And... come see me again soon, ok?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Maybe we can do something. Something normal!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Like a date?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Like generate some friction?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Like get some ice cream at the Yummy Yeti?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/c-6/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "That would be amazing. I think we make a great pair."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/c-7/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Now that sounds like fun..."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/c-7/15
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "I might bring a bit of my wild side back for that."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/c-7/23
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "If you don't mind!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/c-7/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's the kind of crazy I can get behind."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/c-7/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "On second thought, maybe we just hang out as friends."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/c-7/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Or in front of, or on top of, or under..."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/c-7/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "I'm fine with that, too."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/c-7/31/c-1/15 arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/c-8/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Come see me soon!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/c-8/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "I would love that!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/c-8/15
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "As friends? Or...?"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/c-8/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "As friends, Arma."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/c-8/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm talking about a date, Arma."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/c-8/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "That sounds perfect!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaAftermath4/0/g-2/c-8/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Arma"
msgid "Come see me again soon!"
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Despite it all, it's difficult to see Arma like this. She's so still and quiet."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/8
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Can't believe her battery's really out."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's better this way. She wasn't happy."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I could just rez her with a new battery."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Let's at least let Wallace say goodbye."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "He was always fond of her."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-0/26 arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-0/53/c-0/7
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "Wall."
msgstr ""

#: arma_alarm/ArmaDeadEnding/0/c-0/34
msgctxt "Wallace"
msgid "Wall wall. Wall."
